OL,3,AUK borrows more than expected in July
OL,4,Aas Healey prepares for first Budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government borrowed more than
OL,7,Fexpected in July, according to figures
OL,8,Fpublished as Chancellor John Healey
OL,9,Fdraws up his first Budget.
OL,11,FThe Office for National Statistics
OL,12,F(ONS) said borrowing, the gap between
OL,13,Fwhat the government spends and what it
OL,14,Fcollects in tax, was #1.8bn during the
OL,15,Fmonth.
OL,17,FOfficial forecasters had expected a
OL,18,Fsurplus of #500m, meaning the
OL,19,Fgovernment borrowed #2.3bn more than
OL,20,Fpredicted.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
