OL,3,AUK borrows more than expected in July
OL,4,Aas Healey prepares for first Budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FEconomists warned the figure will
OL,7,Frestrict Healey and Prime Minister Andy
OL,8,FBurnham's room for manoeuvre as they
OL,9,Ftarget measures aimed at easing the
OL,10,Fcost of living for households, with
OL,11,Flittle room to increase borrowing in
OL,12,Fthe Budget on 27 October.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
